{"id":"testimonialwall","code":"<style>.twl{width:340px;height:250px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:8px 6px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000,transparent 92%);mask:linear-gradient(#000,transparent 92%)}\n.twl .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;height:100%}\n.twl .col{overflow:hidden}\n.twl .stk{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n.twl .c1 .stk{animation:twlu 14s linear infinite}.twl .c2 .stk{animation:twld 18s linear infinite}.twl .c3 .stk{animation:twlu 16s linear infinite}\n@keyframes twlu{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(-50%)}}\n@keyframes twld{from{transform:translateY(-50%)}to{transform:translateY(0)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.twl .stk{animation:none}}\n.twl .c{border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:var(--card,#171B22);border-radius:12px;padding:10px}\n.twl .c .st{color:var(--accent,#3366FF);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px}\n.twl .c p{margin:4px 0;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:450 9px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.4}\n.twl .c b{color:var(--ink,#fff);font:600 9px Inter,sans-serif}</style>\n<div class=\"twl\"><div class=\"cols\">\n<div class=\"col c1\"><div class=\"stk\"><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Analytics revolutionised our cycle.</p><b>Alex R.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Dev speed has doubled.</p><b>Raj P.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Analytics revolutionised our cycle.</p><b>Alex R.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Dev speed has doubled.</p><b>Raj P.</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"col c2\"><div class=\"stk\"><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>A 50% lift in conversions.</p><b>Samantha L.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Localization is seamless now.</p><b>Emily C.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>A 50% lift in conversions.</p><b>Samantha L.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Localization is seamless now.</p><b>Emily C.</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"col c3\"><div class=\"stk\"><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>An edge in predictive accuracy.</p><b>Michael B.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Costs cut across logistics.</p><b>Linda W.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>An edge in predictive accuracy.</p><b>Michael B.</b></div><div class=\"c\"><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><p>Costs cut across logistics.</p><b>Linda W.</b></div></div></div>\n</div></div>"}